This package is extracted from TheKernel's transactional Credential v2 work,
distributed under Apache-2.0. The exact source and design commits are recorded
in VENDOR.md, and TheKernel extraction changes are described in PATCHES.md.

The Linux and FreeBSD source snapshots listed in VENDOR.md were consulted to
understand observable credential, user-namespace, capability, and policy
semantics. No Linux or FreeBSD source text is copied into this package.
